                                "sense_id": "8dc53700-4ea7-3d26-aeb1-017faafd9850",
                                "text": "De bled en herbe vous faictez belle saulce verde … laquelle … dilate les vases spermaticques, abbrevie les cremasteres, expurge la vessie, enfle les genitoires, corrige le prepuce, incruste le balane, rectifie le membre.",
                                "translation": "Of corn in the blade you may make good green sauce … which … dilates the spermatic vessels, shortens the cremasters, purgeth the bladder, puffeth up the genitories, correcteth the prepuce, hardens the nut, and rectifies the member.",
